  "rationale": "Use a minimal plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in small deterministic specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear space, uses short directed turns for side obstacles, uses a rare one-shot backward escape only for front blockage, and escalates to full_rotate only through a dedicated repeated-failure path. Action states are modeled as one-shot commit states with obstacle events able to preempt only when safety-critical.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate unrestricted sensing/motion plants from supervisory policy specifications",
    "Bias clear-space behavior to move_forward, use random_walk only as a secondary exploration mode, recover from obstacles with brief directed turns, and reserve move_backward/full_rotate for dedicated front-obstacle escalation states"
